["<aside class=\"callout why\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>Taking the bolt out is the only strip CZ asks of you. Do it right and you clean better, store safer and never lose a part.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 334\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The stop line for the CZ 457. You: magazine out, bolt out, clean, check the stock screws at 3.5 newton metres, set the trigger screws as the manual shows. A gunsmith: stripping the bolt, striker and spring, trigger repair, taking the barrel off, bolt cleaning after many rounds, and any rifle that was dropped or rusted. CZ: do not strip your firearm any further.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"334\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Where you stop</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"44\" width=\"372\" height=\"110\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">You do this</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Magazine out. Bolt out. Clean.</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Check stock screws, 3.5 Nm.</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Trigger set screws, per manual.</text><rect x=\"14\" y=\"166\" width=\"372\" height=\"132\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"194\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">Gunsmith does this</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Strip the bolt: striker, spring.</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"242\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Trigger group repair. Barrel off.</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"264\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Bolt cleaning after many rounds.</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"286\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Anything dropped or rusted.</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"322\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">CZ: &quot;Do not strip your firearm any further.&quot;</text></svg>\n</figure><ul><li>You: magazine out, bolt out, stock screws <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Further than that: a gunsmith <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: what CZ allows</summary><ul><li>CZ's whole stripping procedure: remove the magazine, shift the safety to off, open the bolt, depress the bolt catch and pull the bolt out (95%, CZ manual page 9).</li><li>\"No further disassembly is needed for routine maintenance\" <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>\"CAUTION: Do not strip your firearm any further. If you assume that your firearm requires adjustment or repair, entrust this work to a competent gunsmith in a specialized workshop!\" <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>After \"a great number of cartridges\", have a gunsmith clean the bolt <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Removing the bolt is also one of the legal storage options for a non restricted rifle (99%, storage regulations s. 5, via <a href=\"#/s/firearm-care\">firearm care</a>).</li></ul></details>","<div class=\"steps\" data-n=\"4\"><div class=\"steps-head\"><b>Take the bolt out in 4 steps</b><span class=\"steps-count\">1 of 4</span></div><div class=\"steps-track\"><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Taking the bolt out of the CZ 457, step 1 of 4: PROVE it, magazine out. Empty chamber, empty well.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"31\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"32\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">PROVE it, magazine out</text><g transform=\"translate(0 10) scale(1.0)\"><path d=\"M14 108 L128 116 L140 118 L300 120 Q314 121 318 126 L318 132 Q300 138 250 140 L200 141 L162 141 Q150 141 146 150 L136 170 Q132 176 124 174 L120 172 Q126 156 122 146 Q112 142 96 146 L14 168 Z\" fill=\"#9A6B3F\"/><path d=\"M30 116 Q80 120 120 124\" stroke=\"#6E4A2A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"7\" y=\"106\" width=\"8\" height=\"64\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><path d=\"M232 105 L390 107 L390 115 L232 117 Z\" fill=\"#4A5156\"/><rect x=\"386\" y=\"106\" width=\"5\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"255\" y=\"99\" width=\"16\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"266\" y=\"96\" width=\"4\" height=\"4\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><path d=\"M374 107 L376 97 L388 97 L388 107 Z\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"102\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#4A5156\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"99\" width=\"78\" height=\"4\" fill=\"#8C959B\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"100\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"210\" y=\"100\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"176\" y=\"105\" width=\"36\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"176\" y=\"106\" width=\"36\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#C9CFD3\"/><rect x=\"128\" y=\"104\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"121\" y=\"107\" width=\"8\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#D8B23A\"/><path d=\"M153 111 L148 131\" stroke=\"#2