\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#D8B23A\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\".8\"/><path d=\"M158 141 Q156 160 176 160 L196 160 Q204 160 204 141\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M178 141 Q183 150 176 156\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"231\" y=\"139\" width=\"4\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#D8B23A\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"158\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"138\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(0 -60)\"><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"139.0\" y2=\"150.0\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M150 150 L139.0 144.0 L139.0 156.0z\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><line x1=\"176\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"176.0\" y2=\"179.0\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M176 190 L182.0 179.0 L170.0 179.0z\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/></g><text x=\"200\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">Push home, turn the handle down.</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"254\" width=\"384\" height=\"36\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"277\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">Muzzle safe. Finger off. Treat it as loaded.</text></svg>\n<figcaption><b>2.</b> Push it home and turn the handle down.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"step-frame\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Putting the bolt back in the CZ 457, step 3 of 3: Safety check. Cycle bolt and safety. It stays cocked.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"31\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">3</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"32\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Safety check</text><g transform=\"translate(0 10) scale(1.0)\"><path d=\"M14 108 L128 116 L140 118 L300 120 Q314 121 318 126 L318 132 Q300 138 250 140 L200 141 L162 141 Q150 141 146 150 L136 170 Q132 176 124 174 L120 172 Q126 156 122 146 Q112 142 96 146 L14 168 Z\" fill=\"#9A6B3F\"/><path d=\"M30 116 Q80 120 120 124\" stroke=\"#6E4A2A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"7\" y=\"106\" width=\"8\" height=\"64\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><path d=\"M232 105 L390 107 L390 115 L232 117 Z\" fill=\"#4A5156\"/><rect x=\"386\" y=\"106\" width=\"5\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"255\" y=\"99\" width=\"16\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"266\" y=\"96\" width=\"4\" height=\"4\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><path d=\"M374 107 L376 97 L388 97 L388 107 Z\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"102\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#4A5156\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"99\" width=\"78\" height=\"4\" fill=\"#8C959B\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"100\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"210\" y=\"100\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"176\" y=\"105\" width=\"36\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"176\" y=\"106\" width=\"36\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#C9CFD3\"/><rect x=\"128\" y=\"104\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"121\" y=\"107\" width=\"8\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><path d=\"M153 111 L148 131\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"147\" cy=\"136\" r=\"6.5\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"130\" y=\"119\" width=\"22\" height=\"6\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><circle cx=\"146\" cy=\"122\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"131\" y=\"117.5\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\".8\"/><path d=\"M158 141 Q156 160 176 160 L196 160 Q204 160 204 141\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M178 141 Q183 150 176 156\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"231\" y=\"139\" width=\"4\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#D8B23A\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"158\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"138\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(0 -60)\"><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"180\" r=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">Still out?</text></g><text x=\"200\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">Cycle bolt and safety. It stays cocked.</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"254\" width=\"384\" height=\"36\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"277\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">Muzzle safe. Finger off. Treat it as loaded.</text></svg>\n<figcaption><b>3.</b> Safety check: it must not fire.</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"steps-nav\"><button class=\"steps-prev\" aria-label=\"Back\">‹ Back</button><span class=\"steps-dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><button class=\"steps-next\" aria-label=\"Next\">Next ›</button></div></div><ul><li>Then PROVE it again (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: reassembly in full</summary><ul><li>The manual does not print reassembly steps; it is the stripping steps in reverse (85%, my reading).</li><li>Slide the bolt in with the handle up; if it stops, do not force it: check the bolt is cocked and lined up (Tip).</li><li>Function check on the empty rifle, the same test CZ gives for the trigger: open and close the bolt several times and move the safety on and off. \"During this safety check, the rifle must not discharge\" (95%, CZ manual page 7). On an empty rifle: the cocking indicator must still stick out afterwards (85%, my reading).</li><li>Then with the safety off, pointed safe, press the trigger once to release the striker for storage (95%, unloading steps page 6).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 342\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The CZ 457 seen from underneath: 1 the front connecting screw, part 73, ahead of the magazine, and 2 the rear connecting screw, part 74, behind the trigger guard. CZ says check them and tighten to 3.5 newton metres.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"342\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Stock screws, from below</text><path d=\"M20 150 L120 140 Q150 128 180 136 L340 140 Q372 142 384 150 Q372 158 340 160 L180 164 Q150 172 120 160 L20 150 Z\" fill=\"#9A6B3F\"/><rect x=\"196\" y=\"140\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><path d=\"M150 136 L150 164 L190 164 L190 136 Z\" fill=\"#4A5156\"/><circle cx=\"244\" cy=\"150\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#D8B23A\" stroke=\"#2B3034\"/><circle cx=\"142\" cy=\"150\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#D8B23A\" stroke=\"#2B3034\"/><circle cx=\"244\" cy=\"110\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"244\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><line x1=\"244\" y1=\"121\" x2=\"244\" y2=\"144\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"142\" cy=\"110\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"142\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">2</text><line x1=\"142\" y1=\"121\" x2=\"142\" y2=\"144\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">Butt</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">Muzzle</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"209\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"214\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">1</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"214\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Front connecting screw (part 73)</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"235\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">2</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Rear connecting screw (part 74)</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"268\" width=\"384\" height=\"34\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"290.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">Check and tighten to 3.5 Nm (CZ)</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"330\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#17201A\">Torque driver: a Tip, not a guess.</text></svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Check them. Tighten to 3.5 Nm <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: more</summary><ul><li>\"Check tightening of the stock fixing screws (pos. 73 and 74) and tighten them as necessary with the torque of 3.5 Nm\" (95%, CZ manual page 9). Part 73 is the front connecting screw, 74 the rear (95%, page 12).</li><li>3.5 Nm (newton metres) is about 31 inch pounds (95%, unit conversion).</li><li>Use a small torque driver with the right bit; loose screws open groups (Tip).</li><li>Wood stocks swell and shrink with Harrison rain; check before season (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Taking the bolt out of the CZ 457, step 4 of 4: Press catch, pull bolt. Hold the catch in. Slide the bolt out.\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"31\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">4</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"32\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\">Press catch, pull bolt</text><g transform=\"translate(0 10) scale(1.0)\"><path d=\"M14 108 L128 116 L140 118 L300 120 Q314 121 318 126 L318 132 Q300 138 250 140 L200 141 L162 141 Q150 141 146 150 L136 170 Q132 176 124 174 L120 172 Q126 156 122 146 Q112 142 96 146 L14 168 Z\" fill=\"#9A6B3F\"/><path d=\"M30 116 Q80 120 120 124\" stroke=\"#6E4A2A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"7\" y=\"106\" width=\"8\" height=\"64\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><path d=\"M232 105 L390 107 L390 115 L232 117 Z\" fill=\"#4A5156\"/><rect x=\"386\" y=\"106\" width=\"5\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"255\" y=\"99\" width=\"16\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"266\" y=\"96\" width=\"4\" height=\"4\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><path d=\"M374 107 L376 97 L388 97 L388 107 Z\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"102\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#4A5156\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"99\" width=\"78\" height=\"4\" fill=\"#8C959B\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"100\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"210\" y=\"100\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"176\" y=\"105\" width=\"36\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><rect x=\"130\" y=\"119\" width=\"22\" height=\"6\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><circle cx=\"146\" cy=\"122\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"131\" y=\"117.5\" width=\"9\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#D8B23A\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\".8\"/><path d=\"M158 141 Q156 160 176 160 L196 160 Q204 160 204 141\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M178 141 Q183 150 176 156\" stroke=\"#2B3034\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"231\" y=\"139\" width=\"4\" height=\"9\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#D8B23A\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"158\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"138\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(0 -60)\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"166\" width=\"96\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#C9CFD3\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"164\" width=\"12\" height=\"13\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#2B3034\"/><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"71.0\" y2=\"160.0\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M60 160 L71.0 166.0 L71.0 154.0z\" fill=\"#FF6A13\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"274\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FF6A13\">The catch is on the LEFT side.</text></g><text x=\"200\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#17201A\">Hold the catch in. Slide the bolt out.</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"254\" width=\"384\" height=\"36\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"277\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">Muzzle safe. Finger off. Treat it as loaded.</text></svg>\n</figure><aside class=\"callout rule\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Grandpa's rule (wisdom): Take apart only what you can put back blindfolded. For the CZ, that is the bolt.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Taking the striker out of the bolt. CZ says gunsmith.</li><li>Forcing the bolt back in when it is uncocked or out of line.</li><li>Overtightening stock screws by feel.</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>At the kitchen table, empty: bolt out and back in 5 times. Then the safety check.</p></aside>","<ul><li>CZ 457 manual pages 4, 6, 7, 9 to 12 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>. Storage regulations via firearm care <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>. Checked 2026-10-23.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: all sources</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://czubpimstorage.blob.core.windows.net/strapi-pim/assets/735342000443_CZ_457_05_2025_en_es_cs_de_fr_8dc25ceb9d.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CZ 457 instruction manual, 05 2025 (PDF)</a>: page 4 (bolt out with safety engaged), page 6 (unloading), page 7 (safety check), page 9 (stripping, stock screws 3.5 Nm, caution), page 10 (other parts), page 11 (misfire remedy), page 12 (parts 73 and 74), Fig. 10. Read directly 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Storage, Display, Transportation and Handling of Firearms by Individuals Regulations s. 5, via <a href=\"#/s/firearm-care\">firearm care</a> <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul></details>"]